{
  "name": "Recruiting agencies: reach HR leaders at companies that are hiring",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Recruiting agencies: reach HR leaders at companies that are hiring\n\n### How it works\nAn open role is the best reason to call. Add a row with company_domain and open_role to your sheet. Argorant previews the people at that company with HR and talent titles (free), reveals up to people_per_company of them with checked work emails, and adds them to your campaign with {{open_role}}, so the first line can name the role. Only valid emails join the campaign. The row gets the number of contacts and a status.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per revealed contact with a passing email; people you revealed before are free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Create a sheet with the columns company_domain, open_role, status, contacts and pick it in **New hiring signal** and **Write back**.\n4. Set titles and people_per_company in **Settings**.\n5. Pick the campaign in **Add to campaign** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nAdd a seniority filter, or post the contacts to your team chat before the campaign add.",
        "height": 609,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "2ff934ec-e9aa-4a81-b032-9904d2c56755",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find the people\nFree preview by title at the hiring company, then a paid reveal of up to people_per_company.",
